From 4558d412ed0755468c6c3355d715cebccd96f21c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Etienne Carriere <etienne.carriere@foss.st.com>
Date: Mon, 15 Apr 2024 10:32:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 0004/1695] core: scmi-server: dump source files from
 SCP-firmware v2.13.0

Dump the source tree of SCP-firmware from its release tag v2.13.0.
URL: https://git.gitlab.arm.com/firmware/SCP-firmware.git
Tag: cc4c9e017348 ("doc: Update user_guide.md")

Not all the file from SCP-firmware source are dumped into OP-TEE OS
source tree, several modules (module/ subdirs) and sereval products
(product/ subdirs) are not considered. Unitary tests framework is
are also left aside.

File module/CMakeLists.txt is modified so that lines related to modules
not imported appear as inline comments.

Update scripts/checkpatch_inc.sh to not run checkpatch tool on
SCP-firmware source tree changes since SCP-firmware coding style
differs from OP-TEE coding style. Instead, one should use the Python
scripts from SCP-firmware/tools/.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 51cbc2492930f9c39adbbc27a4e229595e19d142 core: scmi-server: dump source files from SCP-firmware v2.13.0]
Change-Id: I2ad64a71d1e4c67c166eba5726df432abbbbb9af
Signed-off-by: Etienne Carriere <etienne.carriere@foss.st.com>
